:17262\">\n          <p className=\"absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] left-[14px] text-[#1a1a1a] top-[calc(50%-20px)]\" data-node-id=\"366:17263\">\n            Б-2В-86\n          </p>\n          <p className=\"absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] left-[14px] text-[#595959] top-[calc(50%+5px)]\" data-node-id=\"366:17264\">\n            Paulo Gondoni\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"absolute flex items-center justify-center left-[301px] top-[calc(50%-18px)]\" data-node-id=\"366:17265\">\n          <div className=\"-scale-y-100 flex-none rotate-180\">\n            <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] not-italic relative text-[30px] text-black text-left whitespace-nowrap\">‹</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-0 top-[638px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"379:471\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Магазин\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-[130px] top-[638px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"379:473\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Камера\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-[260px] top-[638px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"379:475\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Профиль\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"SUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Node ids have been added to the code as data attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`."},{"type":"text","text":"These styles are contained in the design: beige: #F0EFEB, white: #FFFFFF, black: #000000, helvetica bold 16 0%: Font(family: \"Helvetica\", style: Bold, size: 16, weight: 700, lineHeight: 100, letterSpacing: 0), gray 2: #A5A5A5, gray 4: #7D7D7D, dark brown: #2C1B15, gray 5: #D9D9D9, red: #5F0F10."},{"type":"text","text":"The generated code contains image and SVG URL constants, e.g. const image = `${assetPathPrefix}/<asset file name>`, where assetPathPrefix is declared once at the top of the code and every asset URL interpolates it. These URLs are temporary download sources and expire after 7 days. Download each asset into the project with curl -L, then replace its URL in the generated code with a reference to the downloaded asset. Never use the temporary URLs as runtime image sources."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"structuredContent":null,"isError":false}
